## 🔐 Jurisdiction Scope

This declaration applies to:
- Systems that sell, rent, or fractionalize access based on credential possession  
- Tokenized identity or access rights tied to lifecycle or usage conditions  
- Markets trading compliance tokens, digital keys, or verified behavior receipts  
- Smart contract systems managing behavioral access rights, trust scores, or credential hierarchies  
- NFT or non-transferable token platforms that enforce access, behavior, or privilege  

Any such market operating under lifecycle credential conditions must register and license with Eliam.

